      "en": "He brought out the people who were in it, and put them to work under saws, under iron picks, under axes of iron, and made them go to the brick kiln; and he did so to all the cities of the children of Ammon. Then David and all the people returned to Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "그 가운데 백성들을 끌어내어 톱질과 써레질과 도끼질과 벽돌구이를 하게 하니라 암몬 자손의 모든 성을 이같이 하고 다윗과 모든 백성이 예루살렘으로 돌아오니라",
      "source_text_hash": "02e3220f5bfbd515cb0eb77630706f4c53f3db277bf6574b1c4997616bb18890",
      "translation_text_hash": "da33ad099c5f151d0901a91e393d963007088bceed6006e3be6300eefc982c36",
